WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.611
Good evening. I have a reservation under the name Martin.

00:00:03.861 --> 00:00:06.053
For two nights, is that right?

00:00:06.303 --> 00:00:09.123
Yes. Is breakfast included?

00:00:09.373 --> 00:00:11.766
Yes, from seven to ten.

00:00:12.016 --> 00:00:14.361
Perfect. Where is my room?

00:00:14.611 --> 00:00:17.682
On the second floor. Here is your key.
